#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.desktop.in:3
msgid "Pigoune"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.desktop.in:4
msgid "Organize, find and reuse your icons, logos and illustrations"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.desktop.in:10
msgid "icons;logos;svg;assets;library;graphics;"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Organize, find and reuse your graphic assets"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"All your graphic assets, organized and within reach. Drop your icons, logos "
"and illustrations into Pigoune: it keeps a safe copy, helps you organize "
"them and gives them back with a simple drag and drop."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"Import SVG, PNG, JPEG, WebP, AVIF, JPEG XL, GIF, TIFF, BMP and ICO files"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid "Organize with nested collections, smart collections, tags and favorites"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "Find anything instantly with search and filters"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid "Reuse assets with drag and drop or the clipboard"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Convert assets to PNG, JPEG, WebP, AVIF or ICO, at any size"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "Portable libraries, fully local, original files never touched"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:28
msgid "Browse your graphic assets in a thumbnail grid"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:32
msgid "Narrow down your library with search and filters"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:36
msgid "Look closely at an asset and step through its animation"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:40
msgid "Convert assets to PNG, JPEG, WebP, AVIF or ICO"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:44
msgid "See what your library holds, in light or dark style"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:48
msgid "Combine words with “and” or “or” in one click"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:52
msgid "Save a search as a smart collection that fills itself"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:56
msgid "Find the images that fit your screen"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:60
msgid "Frame any image and set it as your wallpaper"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:97
msgid ""
"A short window now tells you what is new after each update, and clearing the "
"thumbnails moves to the library information."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:99
msgid ""
"A short window sums up the main news the first time a new version starts. "
"You can turn it off in the Preferences."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:100
msgid ""
"Clearing the thumbnails is now done in the Storage tab of the library "
"information, next to the space they take, instead of in the Preferences."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:106
msgid ""
"Much faster on large libraries, a clearer wallpaper window and shorter, "
"simpler tags."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:108
msgid ""
"Opening a library and searching are several times faster, and scrolling "
"through thousands of thumbnails stays smooth, even before they have been "
"created."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:109
msgid ""
"A tag is now a single word of up to 20 characters: a space ends the tag you "
"are typing and a hyphen joins several words. Existing tags are left as they "
"are."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:110
msgid ""
"The wallpaper framing window is rearranged around the virtual screen, with a "
"discreet note when the image will look blurry."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:111
msgid ""
"Long names are shortened instead of stretching the panels, and the windows "
"fit the narrowest size even with larger text."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:112
msgid ""
"The search finds œ and æ when you type oe and ae, and exporting can no "
"longer ask for a size that would crash Pigoune."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:113
msgid ""
"Pigoune now tells you when an image cannot be loaded and when links were "
"ignored while importing a folder."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:119
msgid "Turn your images into wallpapers, framed exactly the way you want."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:121
msgid ""
"Frame an image on a virtual copy of your screen, under the bars of your "
"desktop, and set it as your wallpaper."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:122
msgid ""
"Fill the empty space with a color of the image, a gradient, a blur or a "
"mosaic, and darken or mirror the image if you wish."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:123
msgid ""
"Filter assets by shape and keep only the images that fit your screen, also "
"in smart collections."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:124
msgid ""
"Libraries opened with Pigoune 2.2 can no longer be opened with older "
"versions."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:130
msgid "Pigoune speaks more languages and looks the same everywhere."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:132
msgid ""
"The interface is now available in German, Spanish, Brazilian Portuguese, "
"Italian, Dutch and Polish."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:133
msgid ""
"Choose the language of Pigoune in the preferences, or keep the one of your "
"system."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:134
msgid "The icons of Pigoune are the same on every distribution."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:140
msgid ""
"A fresh look for the sidebar, the details and the preview, collections with "
"their own icon and color, and a search by color."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:142
msgid "Each collection can have its own icon and color."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:143
msgid "Filter assets by their main colors, or by any color you pick."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:144
msgid "The sidebar folds its sections and shows tags as pills."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:145
msgid ""
"The details panel is organized in foldable sections, with quick actions and "
"the detected colors."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:146
msgid ""
"The preview zooms in from the thumbnail, shows a strip of thumbnails and can "
"show the details panel next to the asset."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:147
msgid "The library information and the preferences are organized in tabs."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:148
msgid ""
"Libraries opened with Pigoune 2.0 can no longer be opened with older "
"versions."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:154
msgid "Update notices and smoother organizing."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:156
msgid ""
"Pigoune tells you when a new version is available and installs it in one "
"click."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:157
msgid "Creating a collection can now be undone."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:158
msgid ""
"A rename in the details panel is confirmed by clicking anywhere else, and "
"the full name appears when it is shortened."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:159
msgid ""
"The shortcuts window lists the keys of the sidebar, and a few preferences "
"are worded more clearly."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:165
msgid "Smart collections, richer searches and more preferences."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:167
msgid ""
"Create smart collections that fill themselves with the assets matching your "
"words, types and favorites."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:168
msgid ""
"Search several words at once: words joined by “and” must all be found, words "
"joined by “or” are alternatives."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:169
msgid "The search shows where it looks and how many assets it found."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:170
msgid ""
"New preferences: thumbnail background, format badges, double-click to open, "
"search the whole library, and showing or hiding tags and smart collections "
"in the sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:171
msgid "The details panel keeps the same width whatever the selected asset."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:172
msgid ""
"Libraries opened with Pigoune 1.6 can no longer be opened with an older "
"version, so update Pigoune on all your computers."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:178
msgid "Pigoune now has its own website and updates itself."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:180
msgid "The About window links to the new website of Pigoune."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:181
msgid "Pigoune installed from its website updates itself through Software."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:187
msgid "Libraries ready to grow, and their real location shown in Flatpak."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:189
msgid ""
"Assets are now sorted into small subfolders inside a library, so very large "
"libraries stay easy to handle for file managers, backups, sync tools and USB "
"drives."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:190
msgid ""
"The welcome page, the recent libraries and the library information show the "
"real folder of a library instead of a technical path."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:191
msgid ""
"Libraries opened with Pigoune 1.5 can no longer be opened with an older "
"version, so update Pigoune on all your computers."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:197
msgid ""
"A big update, with new formats, conversion and a closer look at your "
"libraries."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:199
msgid ""
"Import AVIF, JPEG XL, TIFF and BMP images, and play animated PNG and WebP "
"images."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:200
msgid "Pause an animation in the preview and step through it frame by frame."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:201
msgid ""
"Export assets converted to PNG, JPEG, WebP, AVIF or ICO, with size, quality, "
"background and multi-size icons."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:202
msgid ""
"See the key figures of a library, a chart of the space used by each format, "
"its disk space and its records."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:203
msgid "Reopen recent libraries from the main menu or the welcome page."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:204
msgid ""
"Choose whether to reopen the last library, play animations on hover and how "
"many recent libraries to keep, and clear the thumbnails."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:205
msgid ""
"Libraries opened with Pigoune 1.4 can no longer be opened with an older "
"version, so update Pigoune on all your computers."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:211
msgid "Take a much closer look at your assets in the detailed preview."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:213
msgid ""
"Move between assets with on-screen arrows, a two-finger swipe, Home and End."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:214
msgid "See the format, dimensions and size of the shown asset."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:215
msgid ""
"Drag the image freely, zoom with new buttons, and fill the screen with F11."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:216
msgid "Spot the real edges of an image and, from 800%, every single pixel."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:217
msgid "Star, copy, export or open the shown asset without leaving the preview."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:218
msgid "Switch between the sizes stored in an ICO file."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:219
msgid "Open any asset in another application with Open With."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:220
msgid "Grab the window more easily by the middle of the library header."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:226
msgid "Stop the thumbnail grid from flickering while the window is resized."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:231
msgid "Give the thumbnail grid a cleaner look."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:233
msgid "Thumbnails sit in square frames, evenly spaced across the whole width."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:234
msgid "Favorites show a larger yellow star that grows with the thumbnails."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:235
msgid "A new preference hides the names under the thumbnails."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:236
msgid ""
"Small images stay sharp, and the lasso shows the selection while it is drawn."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:242
msgid "Add a user guide, available from the main menu or with F1."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:247
msgid "The first public version of Pigoune."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:249
msgid ""
"Import SVG, PNG, JPEG, WebP, GIF and ICO files, or whole folders, with "
"duplicate detection"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.gor3pig.Pigoune.metainfo.xml.in:250
msgid ""
"Organize assets with nested collections, tags, favorites, notes and credits"
